{
  "name": "Zammad ticket triage with Hesperan (Auto or Review)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Zammad ticket triage with Hesperan\n\n**Who it's for:** support teams on Zammad who want new tickets routed to the right group automatically, but only when the routing is safe.\n\n**What it does:** every new ticket goes to a calibrated Hesperan decision profile. When the calibrated confidence reaches the profile's threshold, the item leaves on **Auto** and the ticket is moved to that group. Everything else leaves on **Review**: the ticket gets the tag `hesperan-review` and an internal note with the suggestion, and a person decides.\n\n**Setup**\n1. In the Hesperan console, create and calibrate a profile (here `ticket-routing`) whose answers are your Zammad **group names**.\n2. Add a Hesperan credential (API key `hsp_…`).\n3. In Zammad, create a Webhook to this workflow's production URL and a Trigger *Ticket created → Webhook*.\n4. Add a Zammad credential (token) and, for the tag call, a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Token token=YOUR_TOKEN`. Replace `zammad.example.com`.\n5. Create the n8n Data Table `hesperan_decisions` with text columns `ticket_id`, `decision_id`, `decision`, `action`. The *outcome feedback* template reads it.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "60ba9d32-e1c1-50de-90f0-f22a6f4845f0",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Auto\nConfidence reached the profile threshold: act on the decision.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "91d3d918-5ff6-57da-bb1c-9c99101704f5",
      "name": "Auto section",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Review\nBelow the threshold: tag the ticket and leave the call to a person.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 3
      },
